LLVM libunwind

The Emscripten 4.0.20 SDK includes LLVM libunwind under
system/lib/libunwind. That SDK directory does not ship a separate CREDITS.TXT;
individual copyright holders are retained in the source files and in LLVM's
project history.

Project: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/tree/main/libunwind
SDK source: https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/tree/4.0.20/system/lib/libunwind
